## 🚀 Passi di Migrazione

### 1. Aggiornamento Dipendenze
```bash
# Installa nuove dipendenze
composer require tightenco/parental
composer require spatie/laravel-model-states

# Aggiorna FullCalendar se necessario
composer update saade/filament-fullcalendar
```

### 2. Migrazione Modelli

#### User Model
```php
// ❌ PRIMA
class User extends Authenticatable
{
    use HasRoles; // Spatie Permission
}

// ✅ DOPO
class User extends Authenticatable
{
    use HasChildren; // Parental STI

    protected array $childTypes = [
        'patient' => Patient::class,
        'doctor' => Doctor::class,
        'admin' => Admin::class,
    ];
}
```

#### Modelli Specializzati
```php
// ✅ NUOVO: Patient Model
class Patient extends User
{
    use HasParent;

    // Logica specifica paziente
}

// ✅ NUOVO: Doctor Model
class Doctor extends User
{
    use HasParent, BelongsToTenant;

    public function getTenantKey(): string
    {
        return 'studio_id';
    }
}
```

### 3. Migrazione Widget

#### Struttura Base
```php
// ❌ PRIMA
class PatientCalendarWidget extends XotBaseFullCalendarWidget
{
    public function canView(): bool
    {
        return auth()->user()->hasRole('patient');
    }
}

// ✅ DOPO
class PatientCalendarWidget extends FullCalendarWidget
{
    use HasFullCalendarConfig;

    public Model|string|null $model = Appointment::class;

    public function canView(): bool
    {
        return auth()->user()?->type === UserType::PATIENT;
    }
}
```

#### Metodo fetchEvents
```php
// ❌ PRIMA
public function fetchEvents(array $fetchInfo): array
{
    $user = auth()->user();

    if ($user->hasRole('patient')) {
        $query = Appointment::where('patient_id', $user->id);
    } elseif ($user->hasRole('doctor')) {
        $query = Appointment::where('doctor_id', $user->id);
    }

    return $query->get()->map(/* ... */)->toArray();
}

// ✅ DOPO
public function fetchEvents(array $fetchInfo): array
{
    $cacheKey = $this->getCacheKey() . "_{$fetchInfo['start']}_{$fetchInfo['end']}";

    return cache()->remember($cacheKey, 300, function () use ($fetchInfo) {
        return Appointment::query()
            ->where('patient_id', auth()->id())
            ->whereBetween('start_time', [$fetchInfo['start'], $fetchInfo['end']])
            ->with(['doctor', 'studio'])
            ->get()
            ->map(fn($appointment) => EventData::make()
                ->id($appointment->id)
                ->title($this->formatEventTitle($appointment))
                ->start($appointment->start_time)
                ->end($appointment->end_time)
                ->backgroundColor($this->getAppointmentStatusColor($appointment->status->value))
            )
            ->toArray();
    });
}
```

### 4. Migrazione Configurazioni

#### Panel Configuration
```php
// ❌ PRIMA
public function panel(Panel $panel): Panel
{
    return $panel
        ->id('patient')
        ->middleware(['web', 'auth'])
        ->authGuard('web');
}

// ✅ DOPO
public function panel(Panel $panel): Panel
{
    return $panel
        ->id('patient')
        ->path('/patient')
        ->middleware(['web', 'auth', EnsureUserType::class.':patient'])
        ->widgets([
            PatientCalendarWidget::class,
        ]);
}
```

#### Tenancy per Dottori
```php
// ✅ NUOVO: Panel Dottore con Tenancy
public function panel(Panel $panel): Panel
{
    return $panel
        ->id('doctor')
        ->path('/doctor')
        ->tenant(Studio::class)
        ->tenantMiddleware(['web', 'auth', EnsureUserType::class.':doctor'])
        ->widgets([
            DoctorCalendarWidget::class,
        ]);
}
```

